// The King Black Dragon's five, identified with tools/models/posepreview.py - see the note
// above [king_dragon] in dragons.npc. Shared with its pet, which is the same mesh at 40%.
// Animations converted from the OSRS cache by tools/models/animconvosrs.py, which carries
// each seq's own priority and loop count across. They play on an OSRS base (base_osrs_*),
// so they only belong on a mesh imported from the same cache - a 377 model posed with one
// of these, or the reverse, is the folded-inside-out shape posepreview.py draws.

